  "text": "BentoPDF\nBack to Tools\nBentoPDF›Bates Numbering\nBates Numbering\n\nAdd sequential Bates numbers across one or more PDF files.\n\nClick to select a file or drag and drop\n\nPDF files (multiple supported)\n\nYour files never leave your device.\n\nAdd More Files\nClear All\nchapter-a.pdf\n3.6 KB • 3 pages\nchapter-b.pdf\n2.9 KB • 2 pages\n2 files • 5 total pages\nSelect Style\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 000001 Page 1\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 00001 Page 1\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 0001 Page 1\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 001 Page 1\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 1 Page 1\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 000001\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 00001\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 0001\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 001\nExhibit 1 Case XYZ 1\nCase XYZ 000001\nCase XYZ 00001\nCase XYZ 0001\nCase XYZ 001\nCase XYZ 1\n000001, 000002, 000003\n00001, 00002, 00003\n0001, 0002, 0003\n001, 002, 003\n1, 2, 3\nCustom style (other)\nCustomize Style\n\nPlaceholders: [BATES] [PAGE] [FILE] [FILENAME]\n\nPreview:\nFile 1, Page 1: 0097 File 1, Page 2: 0098 File 2, Page 1: 0100 File 2, Page 2: 0101 ... File 2, Page 2: 0101\nPosition\nHeader Center\nHeader Left\nHeader Right\nFooter Center\nFooter Left\nFooter Right\nBates Starts From\nFile Counter Starts From\nFont\nHelvetica\nTimes New Roman\nCourier\nFont Size\nColor\nApply Bates Numbers\nSuccess\n\nBates numbers applied successfully! (97 through 101)\n\nOK\nBentoPDF\n\n© 2026 BentoPDF. All rights reserved.\n\nVersion 2.8.10\n\nEnglish",
